<div class="trap-mantra"><span class="lf-ex-label">口訣：</span>「答案要約至最簡」</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-trap-card" data-hq-id="LF-T9-P4-0104">
<div class="lf-trap-header">
<span class="lf-trap-badge">T9 整數</span>
<span class="lf-trap-id">LF-T9-P4-0104</span>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-trap-q">1 - 3/8 = ？</div>
<div class="lf-trap-try"><p style="font-weight:700;color:var(--red);">想想看！為什麼這是陷阱？寫出正確答案：</p></div>
<div class="trap-correct"><span class="lf-ex-label">正確答案：</span>5/8</div>
<div class="trap-mantra"><span class="lf-ex-label">口訣：</span>「整數=分母分之分母，1=8/8」</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-trap-card" data-hq-id="LF-T9-P4-0105">
<div class="lf-trap-header">
<span class="lf-trap-badge">T9 帶分</span>
<span class="lf-trap-id">LF-T9-P4-0105</span>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-trap-q">帶分數 1¾ + 2¼ = ？</div>
<div class="lf-trap-try"><p style="font-weight:700;color:var(--red);">想想看！為什麼這是陷阱？寫出正確答案：</p></div>
<div class="trap-correct"><span class="lf-ex-label">正確答案：</span>4</div>
<div class="trap-mantra"><span class="lf-ex-label">口訣：</span>「整數加整數，分數加分數，分數滿1要進位」</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
